4. credit_history - Provides insight into repayment behavior and history.

### Credit Obligations:
5. credit_amount - Measures the loan amount requested.
6. duration - Captures repayment timeline and affordability.
7. installment_commitment - Reflects the percent of disposable income committed to loan repayment.
